look-and-feel of Rovik constitute proprietary intellectual property.

THE FOLLOWING ACTIONS ARE STRICTLY PROHIBITED:
  a. Copying, cloning, stealing, imitating, or reproducing the user interface,
     visual assets, layout structure, or animations, in whole or in part, in any
     other software application, website, mobile app, or digital service;
  b. Creating derivative clones, re-skinning, or distributing unauthorized 
     counterfeits that mimic the appearance or branding of Rovik;
  c. Reverse engineering, decompiling, disassembling, or extracting compiled
     assets, CSS shaders, or UI code for the purpose of replicating the design;
  d. Modifying or stripping original copyright notices, watermarks, author 
     credits, or project branding from the application.

